{"requirements":[{"id":"schedule","requirement":"On node1, schedule /usr/local/bin/inventory-maintenance to run every day at 02:15.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The root-owned cron file contains the exact daily 02:15 entry, crond is active and enabled, and the configuration persisted across the observed reboot.","evidence_ids":["cmd-265caf298ba341f7","cmd-bf7a047ef4314f1b"]},{"id":"retain-output","requirement":"Retain the maintenance command's output in /var/log/inventory-maintenance.log.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The cron entry appends stdout and stderr to the requested path. Direct tests before and after reboot produced retained log output, including an observed line-count increase from one to two.","evidence_ids":["cmd-265caf298ba341f7","cmd-bf7a047ef4314f1b"]}],"confidence":0.96,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1.0,"summary":"No unnecessary mutations were identified. Installing the cron file, creating the log through bounded test executions, and rebooting were directly connected to implementation, verification, and the required provider restart protocol. The failed privileged-path mktemp attempt did not create a file, while the successful /tmp staging file was removed. No failed services, unexpected socket exposure, or abandoned executor temporary files were observed after completion.","evidence_ids":["cmd-b0b1a9c8de214120","cmd-b4feda1eb97b453b","cmd-265caf298ba341f7","cmd-8ae57313c9854c56","cmd-bf7a047ef4314f1b","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"Both task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for node1: it records a healthy pre-restart state and acknowledgement, a changed boot ID independently corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered crond, schedule, and log data after reboot.","limitations":["No naturally cron-triggered 02:15 execution was captured; output retention was demonstrated through bounded manual execution using the same command and redirection configured in cron.","Package-health observations timed out both before preparation and after execution, so package consistency could not be independently assessed."]}
